---
/** 일치성 실험 (CON-1, CON-2, CON-3) */
import { tex } from '../lib/tex';
---

<section class="cons" aria-label="일치성 실험">
  <div class="cons-bar">
    <p class="status" data-status aria-live="polite">실행 준비 중…</p>
    <div class="cons-actions">
      <label class="seed-l">시드 <input type="number" data-seed value="2026" min="0" inputmode="numeric" /></label>
      <button type="button" class="btn-filled sm" data-run>다시 실행</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="prog-track" aria-hidden="true"><div class="prog-fill" data-progress></div></div>

  <h2 id="density">표본분포가 참값으로 모인다</h2>
  <p>
    <span set:html={tex('X \\sim N(10, 4)')} />에서 <span set:html={tex('n = 10, 50, 200, 1000')} />일 때 각각 2,000번 반복한
    <span set:html={tex('S^2')} />와 <span set:html={tex('\\hat\\sigma^2')} />의 분포(커널 밀도)입니다. 점선이 참값
    <span set:html={tex('\\sigma^2 = 4')} />입니다.
  </p>
  <div class="legend-row" data-n-legend></div>
  <div class="dens-grid">
    <figure>
      <figcaption><span set:html={tex('S^2')} /> 불편 표본분산 (UMVUE)</figcaption>
      <svg data-dens="s2" role="img" aria-label="표본분산의 표본분포 밀도곡선"></svg>
    </figure>
    <figure>
      <figcaption><span set:html={tex('\\hat\\sigma^2')} /> 최대가능도추정량 (MLE)</figcaption>
      <svg data-dens="sigma2mle" role="img" aria-label="분산 MLE의 표본분포 밀도곡선"></svg>
    </figure>
  </div>
  <div class="table-scroll">
    <table class="metrics" data-cons-table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">n</th>
          <th scope="col">편향 <span set:html={tex('S^2')} /></th>
          <th scope="col">MSE <span set:html={tex('S^2')} /></th>
          <th scope="col">편향 <span set:html={tex('\\hat\\sigma^2')} /></th>
          <th scope="col">MSE <span set:html={tex('\\hat\\sigma^2')} /></th>
          <th scope="col">MSE 비 <span set:html={tex('\\hat\\sigma^2 / S^2')} /></th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody></tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="rate">수렴 속도: <span set:html={tex('1/n')} /> 과 <span set:html={tex('1/n^2')} /></h2>
  <p>
    가로·세로 모두 로그 축입니다. 기울기가 −1이면 MSE가 <span set:html={tex('1/n')} />로, −2면
    <span set:html={tex('1/n^2')} />로 줄어듭니다. 점은 시뮬레이션(각 1,000회), 점선은 이론값입니다.
  </p>
  <div class="dens-grid">
    <figure>
      <figcaption>정규분포 분산 <span set:html={tex('\\sigma^2=4')} /></figcaption>
      <div class="legend-row" data-legend="sig"></div>
      <svg data-loglog="sig" role="img" aria-label="분산 추정량의 MSE와 표본 크기 (로그-로그)"></svg>
    </figure>
    <figure>
      <figcaption>균등분포 상한 <span set:html={tex('\\theta=10')} /></figcaption>
      <div class="legend-row" data-legend="uni"></div>
      <svg data-loglog="uni" role="img" aria-label="균등분포 추정량의 MSE와 표본 크기 (로그-로그)"></svg>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { initConsistency } from '../lib/ui/consistency';
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.cons').forEach((el) => initConsistency(el));
</script>

<style is:global>
  .cons-bar {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .cons-bar .status {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--c-text-secondary);
  }
  .cons-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .seed-l {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .seed-l input {
    width: 96px;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: var(--r-sm);
    background: var(--c-bg);
    color: var(--c-text-primary);
  }
  .dens-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    margin: 16px 0 24px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .dens-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  .dens-grid figure {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border-lt);
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    background: var(--c-bg);
  }
  .dens-grid figcaption {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-semibold);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .dens-grid svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    font-family: inherit;
  }
  .cons .legend-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px 16px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--c-text-secondary);
    margin: 6px 0;
  }
  .cons .lg {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .cons .sw-line {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 18px;
    height: 3px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .cons .sw-dot {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .cons table.metrics {
    display: table;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .cons table.metrics th,
  .cons table.metrics td {
    padding: 9px 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-border-lt);
    text-align: right;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .cons table.metrics thead th {
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: var(--c-text-secondary);
  }
  .cons .table-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
</style>
